## Security

The servlet retrieves the logged-in User from the session.

It then obtains the corresponding company using CompanyDAO.

Updates and deletions are restricted by:

- Opportunity ID
- Company ID
- Internship type

This prevents a recruiter from modifying another company's
internship through a forged request.

---

## Validation

The application validates:

- Internship ID
- Internship title
- Description
- Location
- Work mode
- Stipend
- Minimum CGPA
- Eligible branches
- Graduation year
- Required skills
- Application deadline

The minimum CGPA must be between 0 and 10.

---

## Database Operations

Editing uses an UPDATE query restricted to the selected
internship and its owning company.

Deleting uses a DELETE query restricted to the selected
internship and its owning company.

Parameterized SQL is used for user-supplied values.

If a foreign-key constraint prevents deletion because
applications reference the internship, the deletion must
be handled without corrupting application records.

