## Test Cases

### Test 1 - Display Internships

Open the internship management page.

Expected:
Only the logged-in company's internships are displayed.

### Test 2 - Edit Internship

Change the title, description, or other details and save.

Expected:
The database contains the updated values.

### Test 3 - Delete Internship

Select Delete Internship and confirm.

Expected:
The selected internship is removed if database constraints
permit deletion.

### Test 4 - Invalid Internship ID

Submit an invalid ID.

Expected:
The request is rejected.

### Test 5 - Another Company's Internship

Attempt to update an internship belonging to another company.

Expected:
The operation is rejected.

### Test 6 - Job ID

Attempt to use this workflow on a job posting.

Expected:
The operation is rejected because the record is not
an internship.

### Test 7 - Invalid CGPA

Enter a CGPA outside the permitted range.

Expected:
The request is rejected.

